---@field RestoreTestingPlanName string The RestoreTestingPlanName is a unique string that is the name of the restore testing plan. This cannot be changed after creation, and it must consist of only alphanumeric characters and underscores.
---@field ScheduleExpression string A CRON expression in specified timezone when a restore testing plan is executed. When no CRON expression is provided, Backup will use the default expression cron(0 5 ? * * *).
---@field ScheduleExpressionTimezone? string Optional. This is the timezone in which the schedule expression is set. By default, ScheduleExpressions are in UTC. You can modify this to a specified timezone.
